    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "TXT Rachel to view on 0879496889\r\n\r\nLynam Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this stunning Sorohan built top floor apartment. Boasting a large balcony and high ceilings, No. 56 The Sycamore will have instant appeal and is extremely bright and airy.  \r\n\r\nNo. 56 is built to a very high specification and in excellent order throughout with 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and a large open plan kitchen/dining and living room. This property also boasts exclusive use of a spacious attic space with a Stira, providing ample storage.  All floors can be accessed by both lift and stairs through a high spec lobby.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none for convenience with the LUAS within walking distance.  Easy access to the N11, M50, and City Centre.  Goatstown, Sandyford, Ranelagh, Milltown, Stillorgan and Blackrock are also all within easy driving distance. Some of Dublin’s finest schools including St Kilian’s, Mount Anville and Our Lady’s Grove are all within easy reach.  UCD/Smurfit business school are also within an easy distance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Wooden flooring with access to a large Hot press and separate large storage cupboard. Intercom.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom:\r\nGenerously proportioned bathroom contains a bath with overhead shower, wc, wash hand basin.  Tiled floor and part-tiled walls. Large Vanity.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom:\r\nWell-proportioned master bedroom with fitted wardrobes overlooking the front of the\r\nProperty.  Double glazed door to spacious balcony.\r\n\r\nEn-suite:\r\nThe en-suite for the master bedroom has a tiled floor and part-tiled walls.\r\ncorner shower unit, wc., wash-hand basin & vanity mirror.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\r\nDouble sized bedroom. Built-in\r\nWardrobes. Wooden flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining\r\n\r\nKitchen:\r\nVery smart high spec fitted kitchen with wall & floor units, with\r\nstainless steel roller door counter unit and granite worktop.  Integrated Fridge/Freezer and Washing\r\nMachine.  Oven, Gas Hob, Cooker Hood. Dishwasher. Very generous size dining area alongside kitchen.\r\n\r\nSitting Room:\r\nExtremely large spacious sitting room with floor to ceiling window which gives bright\r\nand airy feel to the room. Double Glazed door leading to large balcony for afternoon coffees.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Whilst every attempt has been made to ensure the accuracy of the floor plan contained here, measurements of doors, windows, rooms and any other item are approximate and no responsibility is taken for any error, omission, or misstatement. This plan is for illustrative purposes only and should only be used as such by any prospective purchaser."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Designated parking\r\nTop floor apartment with use of attic space\r\nSorohan built development\r\nWell maintained communal grounds\r\nDouble glazed hardwood windows and doors throughout\r\nHighly sought after location"
      },
      {
